      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you contact us by phone or email, we may collect your name, phone number, and email address for the purpose of responding to your inquiry and scheduling appointments. We do not collect health or dental information through this website.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>Contact information you provide is used solely to communicate with you about your inquiry or appointment. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p>This website does not currently use tracking cookies, analytics platforms, or session-replay software. If that changes in the future, this policy will be updated.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">Protected Health Information</h2>
      <p>This website does not collect or transmit protected health information (PHI). For information about how your health information is handled as a patient, please review our <a href="/hipaa-notice">HIPAA Notice of Privacy Practices</a>.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">External Links</h2>
      <p>This site may contain links to third-party services (such as Google Maps). Those services are governed by their own privacy policies. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external sites.</p>

